<title>USA: WAL-MART STORES JULY SAME-STORE SALES RISE.</title>
<headline>WAL-MART STORES JULY SAME-STORE SALES RISE.</headline>
<dateline>BENTONVILLE, Ark. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	   Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $8.362     $7.515     +11.3     +6.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date   $54.212    $48.517     +11.7     +6.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in billions except percentage.</p>
<p>Month is four weeks ended Aug 1.</p>
<p>Full company name is Wal-Mart Stores Inc</p>
<p>-- Wal-Mart's Sam's Club same store sales increased 1.0 percent in July with total sales of $1.497 million. For the year-to-date period, same store sales rose 3.2 percent with total sales of $9.816 million.</p>
</text>
